# HP40gs Stock Font Gallery through the original APLET UI and serial disk.
# HP40gs boots through the CAS front end, then follows the same lazy HPGCC
# transfer path. Keep Gallery navigation out of the transfer retry window.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
13000 tap home
15000 tap aplet
16000 capture aplet-library
17000 tap f5
18000 capture receive-menu
18500 tap down
19200 tap down
19900 tap down
20200 capture receive-serial-disk
20600 tap enter
40000 capture remote-aplet
41500 tap enter
43000 capture lazy-fetch

# Historical Stock E2E has completed the slow lazy-fetch chain around 371 s.
# One late launch ENTER avoids corrupting Gallery state with retry keystrokes.
43500 monitor 450000
410000 tap enter
425000 capture native-mini
428000 tap down
431000 capture native-main
434000 tap right
437000 capture generated-control
440000 tap on
